{
    "title": "WGT Golf",
    "description": "<p>Take the game you love on the go with Topgolf's #1 free golf game. Play world-famous courses like Pebble Beach, PGA National, and St Andrews without sacrificing realism and authenticity.</p><p>Battle players around the world in multiplayer mode or have fun solo as you level up and collect prizes. Join a country club, enter tournaments and master the world of golf from anywhere with the most realistic golf game around.</p>\r\n<b>WGT includes:</b><ul>\r\n<li><b>Iconic golf courses</b> - tee off on Chambers Bay, Brandon Dunes, Congressional and many more</li>\r\n<li><b>18-hole stroke play</b>  - take on full courses in just one of many available gameplay modes</li>\r\n<li><b>Head-to-Head multiplayer</b>  - clash against players all over the globe in PvP</li>\r\n<li><b>Topgolf mode</b>  - test your accuracy and compete against friends</li>\r\n<li><b>Country Clubs</b>  - join a club, play in club vs. club tournaments and earn rewards</li>\r\n<li><b>Tournaments</b>  - become a WGT legend and win big prizes</li>\r\n<li><b>Real-world equipment and accessories</b>  - play with the same top-of-the-line equipment your favorite pros use</li>\r\n<li><b>Weekly events</b>  - enter one of the many regularly recurring events featured in WGT</li>\r\n<li><b>Goals & Achievements</b>  - earn rewards and track your lifetime progress</li></ul><p>A network connection is required to play WGT Golf. For the best experience, high speed internet is recommended.</p>\r\n Need Help/Support:  <a>https://m.wgt.com/help/request</a>\r\n\r\nTerms & Conditions:  <a>https://m.wgt.com/terms</a>\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy:  <a>https://m.wgt.com/privacy</a>",
    "descriptionHTML": "<p>Take the game you love on the go with Topgolf&#39;s #1 free golf game. Play world-famous courses like Pebble Beach, PGA National, and St Andrews without sacrificing realism and authenticity.</p><p>Battle players around the world in multiplayer mode or have fun solo as you level up and collect prizes. Join a country club, enter tournaments and master the world of golf from anywhere with the most realistic golf game around.</p><br><b>WGT includes:</b><ul><br><li><b>Iconic golf courses</b> - tee off on Chambers Bay, Brandon Dunes, Congressional and many more</li><br><li><b>18-hole stroke play</b>  - take on full courses in just one of many available gameplay modes</li><br><li><b>Head-to-Head multiplayer</b>  - clash against players all over the globe in PvP</li><br><li><b>Topgolf mode</b>  - test your accuracy and compete against friends</li><br><li><b>Country Clubs</b>  - join a club, play in club vs. club tournaments and earn rewards</li><br><li><b>Tournaments</b>  - become a WGT legend and win big prizes</li><br><li><b>Real-world equipment and accessories</b>  - play with the same top-of-the-line equipment your favorite pros use</li><br><li><b>Weekly events</b>  - enter one of the many regularly recurring events featured in WGT</li><br><li><b>Goals &amp; Achievements</b>  - earn rewards and track your lifetime progress</li></ul><p>A network connection is required to play WGT Golf. For the best experience, high speed internet is recommended.</p><br> Need Help/Support:  <a>https://m.wgt.com/help/request</a><br><br>Terms &amp; Conditions:  <a>https://m.wgt.com/terms</a><br><br>Privacy Policy:  <a>https://m.wgt.com/privacy</a>",
